NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS AND DATASETS

This licence covers the code in this repository only.

Base models (Qwen3, Mistral Small, Ministral) carry their own licences, which
you must accept on their respective Hugging Face model pages. A LoRA adapter
trained from a base model is generally subject to that base model's licence
terms; check them before redistributing an adapter.

The synthetic examples in data/examples/ are development fixtures released
under this same licence. They are NOT the KLEOS research dataset.
